/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="15" height="15" class="icon outbound"><path fill="currentColor" d="M18.8,85.1h56l0,0c2.2,0,4-1.8,4-4v-32h-8v28h-48v-48h28v-8h-32l0,0c-2.2,0-4,1.8-4,4v56C14.8,83.3,16.6,85.1,18.8,85.1z"></path> <polygon fill="currentColor" points="45.7,48.7 51.3,54.3 77.2,28.5 77.2,37.2 85.2,37.2 85.2,14.9 62.8,14.9 62.8,22.9 71.5,22.9"></polygon></svg> <span class="sr-only">(opens new window)</span></span></a></li></ul></div> <div class="content-footer" data-v-5b0b93f5=""><div class="help-callout" data-v-bed3e0e4="" data-v-5b0b93f5=""><p data-v-bed3e0e4=""><b data-v-bed3e0e4="">Help us improve this site!</b></p> <p data-v-bed3e0e4=""><a href="https://github.com/ipfs/ipfs-docs/edit/main/docs/concepts/ipfs-gateway.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-bed3e0e4="">Edit this page</a> <span data-v-bed3e0e4="">
